<title>USA: USDA adds leather to Indonesia GSM-102.</title>
<headline>USDA adds leather to Indonesia GSM-102.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department on Wednesday said it added leather to the U.S. commodities available to Indonesia under the Export Credit Guarantee Program (GSM-102) for fiscal year 1997.</p>
<p>USDA said the total authorization remains at $100 million.</p>
</text>
